  "details": "Since the new UI update, the Android symbol on nameplates has become incredibly difficult to notice.\n\nI play on PC and usually stick to PC-only avatars unless Quest users are around, in which case I switch to a Quest-compatible one. But with how small and barely noticeable the symbol is now, I often can't tell when someone is on Quest without having to ask them directly.\n\nI'd really appreciate it if the symbol could be made larger or more noticeable again, so it's easier to tell at a glance what platform someone is playing on.",
